{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2022-12-12 09:00:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN AWARDS $1 MILLION TO 57 HAMPTON ROADS NONPROFITS', 'text': "ORGANIZATIONS SUPPORT EDUCATIONAL, ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL EQUITY, AND COMMUNITY ADVANCEMENT INITIATIVES ATLANTA , DEC. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) WILL AWARD $1 MILLION IN GRANTS TO A DIVERSE GROUP OF FIFTY-SEVEN HAMPTON ROADS NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS. THE GRANTS FURTHER NORFOLK SOUTHERN'S LEGACY OF SUPPORTING PEOPLE AND FAMILIES IN THE COMMUNITIES IT SERVES."}